# Planted bugs in allocate(). Each one must make the harness fail.
# Kani ignores CARGO_TARGET_DIR and writes to <crate>/target/kani/, and
# fv-mutate leaves target/ out of its copy, so each run here rebuilds from
# a cold cache.
run fv-kani check_every_part_is_at_most_the_total
properties check_every_part_is_at_most_the_total
file src/lib.rs

mutation the u32 promotion is dropped, so the multiply overflows u16 for a large total
detects check_every_part_is_at_most_the_total
-         parts[i] = ((total as u32) * (percents[i] as u32) / 100) as u16;
+         parts[i] = (total * percents[i] as u16) / 100;

mutation the share is computed as a tenth instead of a hundredth
detects check_every_part_is_at_most_the_total
-         parts[i] = ((total as u32) * (percents[i] as u32) / 100) as u16;
+         parts[i] = ((total as u32) * (percents[i] as u32) / 10) as u16;

harmless a comment on the loop
-     for i in 0..3 {
+     for i in 0..3 {
+         // one part per percent
